     "id": 1169183,
     "content_html": "protectionism was the best policy"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169185,
     "content_html": "the tariff was a subsidy to support northern factories"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169182,
     "content_html": "the South was being unfairly neglected in the spending of federal funds"
    }
